Thodi Jagah Guitar Chords with strumming pattern sung by Arijit Singh from Bollywood Hindi movie Marjaavaan.

Strumming Pattern: DU DU DU DU

Capo on 3rd fret

{c: Intro} [Dm] [G] [F] [G]

Tho [Am]di jagah de de mujhe,        Tere [F]paas kahin reh [G]jaaun main

[Am]Khamoshiyaan teri sunu,        Aur [F]door kahin na [G]jaaun main [Am]

Ap [C]ni khushi de [F]ke main tujhe,        Tere [Am]dard se jud [G]jaaun main…

